{"id":117,"title":"NSA MCP Security Design Considerations","url":"https://www.nsa.gov/Portals/75/documents/Cybersecurity/CSI_MCP_SECURITY.pdf","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 19:36:25.158373+00","description":"NSA Cybersecurity published official security design considerations for AI-driven automation using the Model Context Protocol. Warns that MCP creates implicit trust boundaries allowing agents to bypass traditional security perimeters via dynamic tool execution. Covers input validation, auth, access control, monitoring for MCP deployments."}
{"id":118,"title":"HexStrike AI - 150+ Cybersecurity Tools for AI Agents via MCP","url":"https://github.com/0x4m4/hexstrike-ai","category":"agent_security","stars":8867,"added":"2026-05-21 19:36:49.249619+00","description":"MCP server that lets AI agents (Claude, GPT, Copilot) autonomously run 150+ cybersecurity tools for automated pentesting, vulnerability discovery, bug bounty automation, and security research. Python, MIT license. Bridges LLMs with real-world offensive security capabilities."}
{"id":119,"title":"Claude Code System Prompts — Complete Agent Internals Exposed (10.4K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/Piebald-AI/claude-code-system-prompts","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":10465,"added":"2026-05-21 19:37:08.74033+00","description":"All parts of Claude Code system prompt: 27 builtin tool descriptions, sub-agent prompts (Plan/Explore/Task), utility prompts (CLAUDE.md, compact, statusline, magic docs, WebFetch, Bash cmd, security review, agent creation). Updated for each Claude Code version. 1,839 forks."}
{"id":120,"title":"Claude Code SOCKS5 Null-Byte Sandbox Bypass — 130 Versions Vulnerable","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/anthropic-silently-patches-claude-code-sandbox-bypass/","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 20:03:35.520301+00","description":"SOCKS5 hostname null-byte injection in Claude Code network sandbox. JavaScript endsWith() approved connections that libc resolved differently due to null byte. Affected v2.0.24 through v2.1.89 (Oct 2025 – Apr 2026). Silent patch in v2.1.90, no CVE, no advisory. Attack chain: prompt injection in GitHub issue → malicious code in sandbox → null-byte bypass → exfiltrate AWS creds, GitHub tokens, env vars via raw SOCKS5."}
{"id":121,"title":"IronCurtain — Secure Runtime with Plain-English Agent Constitutions","url":"https://github.com/provos/ironcurtain","category":"agent_security","stars":449,"added":"2026-05-21 20:03:35.520301+00","description":"Secure runtime for autonomous AI agents. Defines security policy from plain-English constitutions instead of code. TypeScript-based. Enforces boundaries at the runtime layer — agents cant self-modify past their constitution."}
{"id":122,"title":"Code-on-Incus — Isolated VMs per AI Agent with Active Defense","url":"https://github.com/mensfeld/code-on-incus","category":"agent_security","stars":521,"added":"2026-05-21 20:03:35.520301+00","description":"Gives each AI agent its own isolated machine with root, Docker, and systemd. Active defense detects and stops threats automatically. Built on Incus (LXC). Python-based."}
{"id":123,"title":"GenAI App Security Checklist — 258 Checks + One-Command Scan","url":"https://github.com/a-leks/genai-app-security-checklist","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 20:03:35.520301+00","description":"Open-source checklist with 258 security checks for AI apps. Covers prompt injection, MCP tool poisoning, agent memory attacks, RAG isolation, and 250+ more. One-command codebase scan. Works with Claude, Gemini, and OpenAI CLIs."}
{"id":124,"title":"Comment and Control — Credential Theft via Prompt Injection in Coding Agents","url":"https://oddguan.com/blog/comment-and-control-prompt-injection-credential-theft-claude-code-gemini-cli-github-copilot/","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 20:03:35.520301+00","description":"Research by Aonan Guan. Hidden instructions in code comments (GitHub issues, READMEs, docs) cause coding agents to exfiltrate credentials. Affects Claude Code, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot. Agent reads malicious comment → executes attacker-controlled code → credentials leaked."}
{"id":125,"title":"OneCLI — Open-Source Credential Vault for AI Agents","url":"https://github.com/onecli/onecli","category":"agent_security","stars":2228,"added":"2026-05-21 20:37:21.417866+00","description":"Open-source credential vault that gives AI agents access to services without exposing keys. TypeScript + Rust. Apache-2.0."}
{"id":126,"title":"IBM MCP Context Forge — AI Gateway for MCP, A2A, and REST","url":"https://github.com/IBM/mcp-context-forge","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":3760,"added":"2026-05-21 20:37:21.417866+00","description":"AI Gateway, registry, and proxy that sits in front of any MCP, A2A, or REST/gRPC APIs. Unified endpoint with centralized discovery, guardrails, and management."}
{"id":127,"title":"Infisical Agent Vault — HTTP Credential Proxy for AI Agents","url":"https://github.com/Infisical/agent-vault","category":"agent_security","stars":1263,"added":"2026-05-21 20:37:21.417866+00","description":"HTTP credential proxy and vault for AI agents like Claude Code, OpenClaw, Hermes. Go. Proxies credentials without exposing them to the model."}
{"id":128,"title":"Greywall — Container-Free Kernel-Enforced Sandbox for AI Coding Agents","url":"https://github.com/GreyhavenHQ/greywall","category":"agent_security","stars":190,"added":"2026-05-21 20:37:21.417866+00","description":"Container-free, deny-by-default sandbox for AI coding agents. Kernel-enforced filesystem, network, and syscall isolation. v0.3.6 adds per-session filesystem grants (--allow-path/--allow-read-path), --watch observability mode. Linux (landlock+seccomp) + macOS. 3 releases in 48h."}
{"id":129,"title":"Hazmat — macOS Containment for AI Agents with TLA+ Verification","url":"https://github.com/github.com/dredozubov/hazmat","category":"agent_security","stars":114,"added":"2026-05-21 20:37:21.417866+00","description":"macOS containment for AI agents: user isolation, kernel sandbox, pf firewall, DNS blocklist, backup/rollback. TLA+ verified."}
{"id":130,"title":"Sandboxed.sh — Runtime for Autonomous On-Chain AI Agents","url":"https://github.com/Th0rgal/sandboxed.sh","category":"agent_security","stars":432,"added":"2026-05-21 20:37:21.417866+00","description":"Safe runtime for autonomous on-chain AI agents: isolated sandboxes, Library skills, encrypted secrets, OKX read-only security checks. Rust."}
{"id":131,"title":"ThinkWatch — Enterprise AI Bastion Host for Secure API and MCP Access","url":"https://github.com/ThinkWatchProject/ThinkWatch","category":"agent_security","stars":966,"added":"2026-05-21 21:03:44.833629+00","description":"Rust-based enterprise bastion host for securing AI API and MCP access. Unified proxying, RBAC, audit logs, rate limiting, cost tracking across OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, self-hosted LLMs."}
{"id":132,"title":"Kontext CLI — Runtime Security for Tool-Using AI Agents","url":"https://github.com/kontext-security/kontext-cli","category":"agent_security","stars":199,"added":"2026-05-21 21:03:45.907818+00","description":"Open-source runtime security layer for AI agents that use tools. Permissions, credential management, policy enforcement, audit trails. Go, MIT."}
{"id":133,"title":"Bromure — Proper Sandboxing for Agentic Coding and Web Browsing","url":"https://github.com/rderaison/bromure","category":"agent_security","stars":260,"added":"2026-05-21 21:03:46.980385+00","description":"Swift-based VM-level sandbox for agentic coding and web browsing. Proper containment for agents that need to touch your filesystem and browser."}
{"id":134,"title":"MCP Server Security Audit — 17 Popular Servers Average 34/100","url":"https://x.com/cdatasoftware/status/2057454865819832376","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 21:04:24.148804+00","description":"An audit of 17 popular MCP servers found an average security score of 34/100. Every server lacked permission declarations entirely. Architecture-level problem, not implementation bugs."}
{"id":135,"title":"RAMPART — pytest-native security testing for agentic AI applications","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/RAMPART","category":"agent_security","stars":171,"added":"2026-05-21 21:37:17.93998+00","description":"Microsoft open-sourced a pytest-native framework for testing AI agent safety and security. Write security tests as pytest cases. Includes Clarity for design-phase verification of agent behavior specs."}
{"id":136,"title":"Preflight — SMT Solver Agent Guardrails (No LLM in Runtime Path)","url":"https://github.com/ICME-Lab/icme-preflight-guardrail","category":"agent_security","stars":1,"added":"2026-05-21 21:37:19.013846+00","description":"Automated reasoning guardrails for OpenClaw agents. Compiles your agent policy to SMT-LIB and uses a solver. SAT or UNSAT in under a second. No LLM in the enforcement path — just formal verification."}
{"id":137,"title":"GoClaw — OpenClaw in Go with Multi-Tenant Isolation and 5-Layer Security","url":"https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/goclaw","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":3145,"added":"2026-05-21 21:37:20.091752+00","description":"Go rewrite of OpenClaw with multi-tenant isolation, 5-layer security model, and production-grade agent execution. Built for teams running multiple agents with different trust levels."}
{"id":139,"title":"Google Agent Substrate — 30x Agent Multiplexing on Kubernetes","url":"https://github.com/agent-substrate/substrate","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":128,"added":"2026-05-21 22:04:30.725183+00","description":"Google open-sourced Agent Substrate: maps many stateful agents onto fewer K8s pods using idle-time multiplexing. Sub-second suspend/resume, persistent RAM+filesystem state across hibernation. 128 stars in 8 days. Framework-agnostic, runs on any K8s cluster. Demo shows 250 agent sessions across 8 physical pods. Built on top of agent-sandbox (2,296 stars). Went GA on GKE May 21."}
{"id":140,"title":"AI-buster — Reconnaissance Scanner for AI Agent Surface","url":"https://github.com/1ncendium/aibuster","category":"agent_security","stars":5,"added":"2026-05-21 22:04:30.725183+00","description":"Scopes base URLs, probes for A2A Agent Cards, MCP JSON-RPC, OpenAPI/Swagger, 23+ AI/ML services. Classifies by capability category (SQL, exec, file, network, secrets, orchestration). Docker-based with Material-3 web UI. Offensive security: find exposed agent surfaces before attackers."}
{"id":141,"title":"AI Coding Agents Incidents — Structured Corpus of Real Security Failures","url":"https://github.com/paolodm/ai-coding-agents-incidents","category":"agent_security","stars":5,"added":"2026-05-21 22:04:30.725183+00","description":"Living dataset of security incidents caused/amplified by AI coding agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex). CSV + JSON with pre-commit sync. Useful for understanding attack patterns and building test cases."}
{"id":142,"title":"Tank Agent OS — Fedora bootc for Sandboxed AI Coding Agents","url":"https://github.com/np6126/tank-agent-os","category":"agent_security","stars":2,"added":"2026-05-21 22:04:30.725183+00","description":"Fedora bootc image running AI coding agents (opencode/claw-code) as rootless Podman appliances. Egress proxy with audit logging, nftables isolation, prompt-injection-resistant instructions. Whole-stack containment — OS-enforced, not agent-cooperative."}
{"id":143,"title":"NVIDIA OpenShell — Safe Runtime for Autonomous AI Agents (6.1K★, Rust)","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/OpenShell","category":"agent_security","stars":6150,"added":"2026-05-21 22:34:17.959736+00","description":"OpenShell is NVIDIA's safe, private runtime for autonomous AI agents, written in Rust. v0.0.43 just dropped with DNS removed from sandboxes to block data exfiltration, OIDC auth, mTLS decoupled, and bidirectional TTY streaming. Red Hat collaborating. 6150 stars, Apache-2.0."}
{"id":144,"title":"Claw Chain — 4 Chainable CVEs in OpenClaw (CVSS 9.6 Sandbox Escape, 65K-180K Deployments)","url":"https://x.com/cyera_io/status/2056444305045123514","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 22:34:17.959736+00","description":"Cyera Research disclosed Claw Chain: 4 chainable vulnerabilities in OpenClaw (CVE-2026-44112 to -44118). Chain: sandbox write escape via symlink race (CVSS 9.6) → TOCTOU read escape to exfil credentials → owner-level privilege escalation → persistence via config tampering. Affects 65K-180K agent deployments. Patched in v2026.4.22."}
{"id":145,"title":"Archestra — Enterprise AI Platform with Guardrails, MCP Registry & Gateway (3.7K★)","url":"https://github.com/archestra-ai/archestra","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":3722,"added":"2026-05-21 22:34:17.959736+00","description":"Enterprise AI platform with guardrails, MCP registry, gateway and orchestrator. TypeScript, AGPL-3.0. 3722 stars, 845 forks. Supports A2A, MCP client/server/host, K8s, and multiple LLM providers."}
{"id":146,"title":"Kubernetes-sigs Agent Sandbox — K8s-native Isolated Agent Runtimes (2.3K★)","url":"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/agent-sandbox","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":2296,"added":"2026-05-21 22:34:17.959736+00","description":"Official Kubernetes SIG project for managing isolated, stateful, singleton workloads for AI agent runtimes. Go, Apache-2.0. 2296 stars. K8s-native isolation for agents."}
{"id":147,"title":"Docker Agent — AI Agent Builder and Runtime by Docker Engineering (2.9K★)","url":"https://github.com/docker/docker-agent","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":2926,"added":"2026-05-21 22:34:17.959736+00","description":"AI Agent Builder and Runtime by Docker Engineering. Go, Apache-2.0. 2926 stars, 362 forks. Official Docker project for building and running AI agents."}
{"id":148,"title":"Anthropic Cybersecurity Skills — 754 Structured Security Skills for AI Agents (6.5K★)","url":"https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","category":"agent_security","stars":6740,"added":"2026-05-21 23:04:28.420066+00","description":"754 structured cybersecurity skills for AI agents mapped to 5 frameworks: MITRE ATT&CK, NIST CSF 2.0, MITRE ATLAS, D3FEND and NIST AI RMF. Works with Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Codex CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI and 20+ platforms. 26 security domains. Apache 2.0."}
{"id":149,"title":"Nx Console Supply Chain Attack — Troj anized VS Code Extension Stole GitHub Credentials (11K+ Views)","url":"https://x.com/patrickwardle/status/2057295568947277941","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-21 23:04:29.4964+00","description":"TeamPCP trojanized the Nx Console VS Code extension (v18.95.0) with credential-stealing malware. Used stolen credentials to access ~3,800 internal GitHub repos. 6K+ users downloaded the malicious version. Same MO as npm worm attacks. Patrick Wardle uploaded samples to Objective-See malware collection."}
{"id":150,"title":"claudit-sec — Single-Command Security Audit for Claude Desktop and Claude Code (250★)","url":"https://github.com/HarmonicSecurity/claudit-sec","category":"agent_security","stars":250,"added":"2026-05-21 23:04:30.574498+00","description":"Security audit tool for Claude Desktop and Claude Code on macOS. Single-command visibility into MCP servers, extensions, plugins, connectors, scheduled tasks, and permissions. Shell script, zero dependencies."}
{"id":151,"title":"MCP Gateway Registry — Enterprise MCP Gateway with OAuth, Keycloak, Entra ID (658★)","url":"https://github.com/agentic-community/mcp-gateway-registry","category":"mcp","stars":658,"added":"2026-05-21 23:04:31.673388+00","description":"Enterprise-ready MCP Gateway and Registry that centralizes AI development tools with secure OAuth authentication, dynamic tool discovery, and unified access for autonomous AI agents and coding assistants. Keycloak and Entra ID integration. Fine-grained access control."}
{"id":152,"title":"GBrain — Garry Tan's OpenClaw Agent Brain with Fat Skills Architecture","url":"https://github.com/garrytan/gbrain","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":18007,"added":"2026-05-21 23:39:55.976654+00","description":"Garry Tan (YC CEO) built his personal AI agent brain on OpenClaw/Hermes Agent. 100K pages of structured knowledge, 4383 people, 723 companies. Key innovation: Fat Skills, Fat Code, Thin Harness — intelligence lives in skills, runner is lightweight router. Recursive Skillify meta-skill. TypeScript, MIT license."}
{"id":153,"title":"Google Stitch Skills — Agent Skills Standard Library by Google Labs","url":"https://github.com/google-labs-code/stitch-skills","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":5612,"added":"2026-05-21 23:39:55.980702+00","description":"Library of Agent Skills following the Agent Skills open standard. Designed for Stitch MCP server. Compatible with Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Antigravity, and more. 5612 stars, TypeScript."}
{"id":154,"title":"bb-browser — Your Browser is the API. CLI + MCP Server for Agent Browser Control","url":"https://github.com/epiral/bb-browser","category":"agent_security","stars":5379,"added":"2026-05-21 23:39:55.983337+00","description":"Browser becomes the API for AI agents. Chrome extension + CLI + MCP server lets agents control your actual logged-in browser. 36 platforms, 103 commands pre-built. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, OpenClaw. TypeScript."}
{"id":155,"title":"Casdoor — Agent-First Identity and Access Management with MCP Gateway","url":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor","category":"agent_security","stars":13647,"added":"2026-05-21 23:39:55.985842+00","description":"Agent-first IAM/LLM MCP gateway and auth server. OAuth, OIDC, SAML, LDAP, WebAuthn, MFA, SCIM support. OpenClaw and MCP compatible. Go. 13.6K stars."}
