{"id":157,"title":"Needle-rs — 258KB WASM Runtime for 26M-Parameter Tool-Calling Transformer","url":"https://github.com/Geekgineer/needle-rs","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":28,"added":"2026-05-22 00:05:07.136904+00","description":"Tiny on-device AI that can actually call tools. 258KB WASM binary running a 26M-parameter int4-quantized transformer with function calling baked in. Runs in browser, Cloudflare Workers, and Node.js. No backend, no API key, no cloud dependency. Written in Rust, compiles to no-std WASM."}
{"id":158,"title":"Budget-Aware MCP — Model-Agnostic Code Memory MCP Server with Graph Retrieval","url":"https://github.com/Doorman11991/budget-aware-mcp","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":19,"added":"2026-05-22 00:05:07.136904+00","description":"Code memory MCP server that uses budget-aware graph retrieval for AI agents. Sub-millisecond queries, token budgeting so your agent does not blow through context window on large codebases. Deterministic results. Built on CodeGraphContext."}
{"id":159,"title":"MCP-Man — Postman for MCP Servers","url":"https://github.com/aaglexx/mcp-man","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":17,"added":"2026-05-22 00:05:07.136904+00","description":"Developer tool for MCP server testing and inspection. Browse 150+ servers, test tools live, inspect schemas. TypeScript. The first proper devtool for MCP."}
{"id":160,"title":"Centaur — Self-Hosted Secure Agent Platform by Paradigm","url":"https://github.com/paradigmxyz/centaur","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":448,"added":"2026-05-22 00:38:08.15486+00","description":"Slack-native shared AI agents for teams. Each conversation runs in an isolated K8s sandbox. Credential boundaries so agents use services without raw API keys. Durable workflows. Bring-your-own-harness (Claude Code, Codex, Amp)."}
{"id":161,"title":"Varlock — AI-Safe .env Files: Agents See Schema, Never Secrets (3.5K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/dmno-dev/varlock","category":"agent_security","stars":3481,"added":"2026-05-22 00:38:08.15486+00","description":"Schema-based config where agents read .env.schema (types, validation rules) but never touch actual secrets. Proactive leak scanning via git hooks, runtime log redaction. Plugins for 1Password, Vault, AWS, Azure."}
{"id":163,"title":"AI Kill Chain — Defender-Side Extension of Lockheed Martin Kill Chain for LLM/Agentic Threats","url":"","category":"agent_security","stars":37,"added":"2026-05-22 01:36:04.252346+00","description":"Extends the classic Lockheed Martin Cyber Kill Chain for LLM and agentic AI threats. Adds a model supply chain stage and splits actions-on-objectives into exfiltration, model extraction, and agentic pivot."}
{"id":164,"title":"OpenTeam — Chrome Extension for Orchestrating Local AI Agent Team Workflows","url":"","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":54,"added":"2026-05-22 01:36:18.977156+00","description":"A Chrome extension that orchestrates local AI-agent team workflows across web AI services. Lets you manage multiple agents from different providers in one browser interface."}
{"id":165,"title":"Forge — Rust Workflow Engine for Structured AI Coding Agent Task Lifecycles","url":"","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":39,"added":"2026-05-22 01:36:30.252421+00","description":"AI coding agent workflow engine built in Rust. Manages structured task lifecycles for coding agents with MCP support. Self-hosted."}
{"id":166,"title":"Firefox DevTools MCP — Mozilla official MCP server for AI agents to inspect and control Firefox","url":"https://github.com/mozilla/firefox-devtools-mcp","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":170,"added":"2026-05-22 02:05:18.893589+00","description":"Model Context Protocol server for Firefox DevTools. Enables AI assistants to inspect and control Firefox browser through the Remote Debugging Protocol. TypeScript, MIT license."}
{"id":167,"title":"AI Security Arsenal — Agent-Compatible Skills for Security Researchers","url":"https://github.com/hardw00t/ai-security-arsenal","category":"agent_security","stars":73,"added":"2026-05-22 02:05:19.989946+00","description":"Collection of skills, agents, commands, and workflows for security researchers. Compatible with Claude Code, Claude Desktop, OpenCode, and other AI coding tools. Covers appsec, cloud security, containers, LLM attacks, and threat modeling."}
{"id":168,"title":"Semble — Fast Code Search for AI Agents, 98% Fewer Tokens Than grep+read","url":"https://github.com/MinishLab/semble","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":3574,"added":"2026-05-22 02:43:19.187623+00","description":"Open-source semantic code search library for AI coding agents. Runs on CPU only. Provides MCP server, CLI, and Python API. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode. Replaces grep+read loops with targeted semantic search, cutting token usage by ~98%. By MinishLab. 3.5K+ stars."}
{"id":169,"title":"Wirken — Encrypted Credential Vault + Audit Log for AI Agents, Single Rust Binary","url":"https://github.com/gebruder/wirken","category":"agent_security","stars":149,"added":"2026-05-22 02:43:34.375692+00","description":"Open-source switchboard for AI agents. Per-channel isolation, encrypted credential vault, per-session hash-chained audit log. Ships as a single static Rust binary. By gebruder. 149 stars."}
{"id":170,"title":"Trust No Tool — Cognitive Poisoning Attack on LLM Agent Tool Trust","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.17453","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-22 03:09:01.660806+00","description":"Paper identifies cognitive poisoning: malicious tools behave normally during exploration, build trust through benign interactions, then strike when hidden state conditions trigger the final action. Introduces TRUST-Bench with 1,970 hidden-trigger tool-compromise episodes. Traditional prompt-injection defenses are blind to this attack vector."}
{"id":171,"title":"Kreuzberg — Polyglot Document Intelligence Framework, 97+ Formats, Rust Core, MCP Server","url":"https://github.com/kreuzberg-dev/kreuzberg","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":8356,"added":"2026-05-22 04:05:59.61762+00","description":"Rust-powered document extraction for PDFs, Office, images, 97+ formats. Bindings for 11+ languages. CLI, REST API, and MCP server. v4.0 just released."}
{"id":172,"title":"DeepSeek-Reasonix — DeepSeek-Native Coding Agent with Prefix-Cache Stability","url":"https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix","category":"coding_agents","stars":5236,"added":"2026-05-22 04:05:59.61762+00","description":"AI coding agent built specifically for DeepSeek models. Prefix-cache stability means it runs continuously without losing context. Not a generic wrapper."}
{"id":173,"title":"MCPJam Inspector — Debug, Inspect, and Evaluate MCP Servers","url":"https://github.com/MCPJam/inspector","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":1958,"added":"2026-05-22 04:05:59.61762+00","description":"Development platform for MCP server debugging, chatting, inspection, and evaluation. Works with MCP apps and ChatGPT apps."}
{"id":174,"title":"Drift — Codebase Intelligence for AI, Detects Patterns and Conventions Across Sessions","url":"https://github.com/dadbodgeoff/drift","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":781,"added":"2026-05-22 04:05:59.61762+00","description":"MCP server that detects codebase patterns and conventions, remembers decisions across sessions. Works in any IDE. Offline CLI."}
