{"id":202,"title":"cc-connect — Bridge Local AI Coding Agents to Messaging Platforms","url":"https://github.com/chenhg5/cc-connect","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":10127,"added":"2026-05-22 10:06:57.913679+00","description":"Go-based bridge that lets you control Claude Code, Codex, Cursor Agent, Gemini CLI from Slack, Telegram, Discord, LINE, Feishu, WeChat Work. No public IP needed. WebSocket + long-polling. 10K+ stars."}
