{"id":207,"title":"Hallmark — Anti-AI-Slop Design Skill for Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex","url":"https://github.com/Nutlope/hallmark","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":1926,"added":"2026-05-22 13:06:39.504108+00","description":"Open-source design skill that prevents AI-generated UI from looking generic. Installs via npx skills add nutlope/hallmark. Gives coding agents design sensibility so UI output looks intentional instead of cookie-cutter."}
{"id":209,"title":"Boris Prompts — Claude Code Skill Using Boris's Prompt Methodology","url":"https://github.com/LingyiChen-AI/boris-prompts","category":"coding_agents","stars":102,"added":"2026-05-22 14:52:59.562228+00","description":"Agent skill that writes high-quality prompts using Boris (Claude Code creator) methodology from Pro Tips & Tricks talk. Five principles: short beats long, examples beat descriptions, negative constraints beat positive, structure beats stream-of-consciousness, context beats cleverness. Works with Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, 50+ agents."}
