{"id":224,"title":"DeepSec — Agent-Powered Vulnerability Scanner from Vercel Labs","url":"https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec","category":"agent_security","stars":2913,"added":"2026-05-22 21:03:18.196283+00","description":"Security harness for finding vulnerabilities in codebases powered by coding agents. Uses Claude or Codex at max thinking levels. Runs fans across worker machines in parallel. Can run on Vercel sandbox microvms. Revalidates findings to cut false positives. Drew Dennison (Semgrep founder) tested it: beat a random code security prompt, lost to Semgrep Mandoline hunt mode on C/C++ — but Mandoline costs $7.13 vs DeepSec's higher cost. 2,874 stars."}
