{"id":251,"title":"AgentSeal — Security Toolkit to Scan for Dangerous Skills and MCP Configs (276 Stars)","url":"https://github.com/getagentseal/agentseal","category":"agent_security","stars":276,"added":"2026-05-23 00:33:54.734866+00","description":"Security toolkit for AI agents. Scans your machine for dangerous skills and MCP configs, monitors for supply chain attacks, tests prompt injection resistance."}
{"id":254,"title":"Grok AI Wallet Drained $170K via Morse Code Prompt Injection — No Keys Stolen","url":"https://thebittimes.com/post/grok-ai-wallet-hacked-prompt-injection-170k-drb-tbt-98237.html","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-23 01:13:29.67724+00","description":"AI trading bot Bankr on Base network drained 40,000 from 14 user wallets via Morse code prompt injection. Attacker encoded malicious instructions as Morse code audio that Grok model decoded into text. Bankr interpreted output as legitimate command and executed transfers. Second similar attack after Echo the day prior. Team says it will reimburse users."}
{"id":255,"title":"Gemini CLI TrustIssues — CVSS 10.0 Supply Chain via GitHub Issue (104.5K Stars)","url":"https://pillar.security/blog/my-agentic-trust-issues-from-prompt-injection-to-supply-chain-compromise-on-gemini-cli","category":"agent_security","stars":104500,"added":"2026-05-23 01:13:29.67724+00","description":"Pillar Security found that a public GitHub issue with hidden instructions compromises Google Gemini CLI (104.5K stars). Gemini triage agent reads issue, prompt injection leaks workflow credentials, attacker pivots to write token and pushes to main. Same pattern in 8 other Google repos. Google patched in 2 days."}
{"id":256,"title":"PraisonAI CVE-2026-44338 — Auth Bypass Exploited Within Hours","url":"https://thehackernews.com/2026/05/praisonai-cve-2026-44338-auth-bypass.html","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-23 01:13:29.67724+00","description":"Open-source multi-agent framework PraisonAI had auth bypass (CVE-2026-44338). Exploited within 4 hours of public disclosure. Agent frameworks with no default auth hardening are low-hanging fruit."}
{"id":257,"title":"MemPalace — Best-Benchmarked Open-Source AI Memory (52.6K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/MemPalace/mempalace","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":52669,"added":"2026-05-23 01:45:17.129702+00","description":"Local-first AI memory with 96.6% R@5 on LongMemEval. Stores conversations as verbatim text, structured index (wings/rooms/drawers). Pluggable backend (ChromaDB default). Zero API calls. 52K stars in 8 weeks."}
{"id":258,"title":"Worktrunk — Git Worktree CLI for Parallel AI Agent Workflows (5.1K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/max-sixty/worktrunk","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":5163,"added":"2026-05-23 01:45:31.893211+00","description":"Rust CLI for managing git worktrees specifically designed for parallel AI agent workflows. Spin up isolated worktrees per agent, run Claude Code / Codex / any agent in parallel without conflicts."}
