{"id":532,"title":"Agents Best Practices — Provider-Neutral Agent Skill for Codex, Claude Code, Cursor (1,057★)","url":"https://github.com/DenisSergeevitch/agents-best-practices","category":"agent_framework","stars":1057,"added":"2026-05-25 06:42:25.947706+00","description":"Provider-neutral Agent Skill for Codex, Claude Code, and agentic harness design. One skill file that works across all major coding agents. 1,057 stars in 10 days."}
