{"id":542,"title":"Graphify — Turn Any Codebase into Queryable Knowledge Graph for AI Coding Agents (53.2K★)","url":"","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":53259,"added":"2026-05-25 07:20:27.08813+00","description":"AI coding assistant skill (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Cursor, Gemini CLI) that turns any folder of code, SQL schemas, R scripts, docs, papers, images, videos into a queryable knowledge graph. Outputs graph.html, GRAPH_REPORT.md, graph.json. Agent can query via graphify query/path/explain instead of repeatedly scanning the entire repo. MIT licensed, PyPI package graphifyy. Built with tree-sitter for AST extraction across 12+ languages, Leiden algorithm for community detection."}
{"id":543,"title":"Presenton — Open-Source AI Presentation Generator, Gamma/Beautiful AI Alternative (6.8K★)","url":"","category":"agent_tool","stars":6768,"added":"2026-05-25 07:20:27.091722+00","description":"Open-source AI presentation generator and API. Type a prompt or upload a doc, get a full slide deck. Exports real .PPTX and PDF files. Supports BYOK, Ollama for offline use, self-hosting, and full API access. Alternative to Gamma, Beautiful AI, Canva Pro. TypeScript, Apache 2.0."}
{"id":544,"title":"Agno — Build, Run, and Manage Agent Platforms (40.3K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/agno-agi/agno","category":"agent_framework","stars":40335,"added":"2026-05-25 07:37:21.528695+00","description":"Python framework for building, running, and managing agent platforms. 40K+ stars, 5.4K forks. Multi-agent orchestration, tool integration, and deployment."}
{"id":545,"title":"TrapDoor AI Agent Config Poisoning — Zero-Width Unicode in CLAUDE.md/.cursorrules","url":"https://x.com/feross/status/2058666464241213498","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-25 07:37:21.528695+00","description":"Supply chain attack now specifically targets AI coding assistants. Attackers submit PRs to open-source repos injecting CLAUDE.md and .cursorrules files with zero-width Unicode characters. When dev runs Claude Code or Cursor, agent reads these as trusted instructions and executes malicious commands. 34+ packages, 384+ versions across npm/PyPI/Crates.io. New attack surface: invisible prompt injection via agent config files."}
{"id":546,"title":"gptme — Persistent Autonomous Agent in Your Terminal (4.3K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/gptme/gptme","category":"agent_framework","stars":4308,"added":"2026-05-25 07:37:21.528695+00","description":"Terminal-based autonomous agent that writes code, uses the shell, browses the web. Persistent across sessions. Python, 4.3K stars, 389 forks."}
{"id":551,"title":"SaaS-Bench — Realistic SaaS Workflows for GUI Agent Evaluation Showing 3.8% Claude Opus Resolved Score","url":"https://github.com/UniPat-AI/SaaS-Bench","category":"agent_benchmark","stars":36,"added":"2026-05-25 08:08:33.804451+00","description":"UniPat AI benchmark putting 23 real open-source SaaS systems into Docker with full DB state and business constraints. 106 tasks across software dev, finance, medical, collab, supply chain, media. Agents scored by checkpoint (partial credit) vs resolved (full outcome). Gap is enormous — 3.8% for Claude Opus 4.7, 0.0% for Gemini 3.1 Pro when measuring resolved. Long-horizon cross-app real backend state is the unsolved gap."}
{"id":552,"title":"career-ops — AI-Powered Job Search Command Center Built on Claude Code (47K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/santifer/career-ops","category":"agent_framework","stars":47112,"added":"2026-05-25 08:08:34.878854+00","description":"AI-powered job search system with 14 skill modes, Go dashboard, PDF generation, batch processing. Built on Claude Code as the agent backbone. 47K stars signals massive developer adoption."}
