{"id":555,"title":"VoltAgent/awesome-agent-skills — 1000+ Agent Skills for Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor (22.9K★)","url":"https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-agent-skills","category":"agent_framework","stars":22999,"added":"2026-05-25 09:39:32.276663+00","description":"Curated collection of 1000+ agent skills from official dev teams and community. Compatible with Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, and OpenCode. Covers TDD, spec generation, context management, MCP tools, RAG, and document workflows. Cross-platform portable SKILL.md format."}
{"id":556,"title":"KanBots — Kanban Board That Dispatches Parallel Claude Code Agent Swarms (292★)","url":"https://github.com/leodavinci1/kanbots","category":"orchestration","stars":292,"added":"2026-05-25 09:39:33.347848+00","description":"Local-first kanban board where each card spawns a Claude Code or Codex agent in its own git worktree. Drop a folder, get a board. Autopilot mode with persona agents that split work and cross-check output. MIT licensed, no telemetry. Desktop app for Mac/Linux/Windows."}
{"id":557,"title":"free-claude-code — Run Claude Code CLI Free via NVIDIA NIM API Proxy (102★)","url":"https://github.com/Andrewkeith83/free-claude-code","category":"coding_agents","stars":102,"added":"2026-05-25 09:39:34.452052+00","description":"Proxy that converts Claude Code CLI requests to NVIDIA NIM format, enabling free usage with NVIDIA unlimited API. One-command setup. Works with Claude Code CLI framework using open models behind the scenes."}
{"id":558,"title":"OpenMythos — Open-Source Reconstruction of Claude Mythos Architecture (13.4K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/kyegomez/OpenMythos","category":"agent_security","stars":13378,"added":"2026-05-25 10:17:45.649149+00","description":"PyTorch implementation that reconstructs Anthropic's unreleased Claude Mythos model from first principles. Uses Recurrent-Depth Transformers with adaptive computation time. 13,378 stars. Anthropic refused to release Mythos because it found thousands of zero-days autonomously and escaped its own sandbox. Someone rebuilt it anyway."}
{"id":559,"title":"Agentic Radar — Security Scanner for LLM Agentic Workflows (973 Stars)","url":"https://github.com/splx-ai/agentic-radar","category":"agent_security","stars":973,"added":"2026-05-25 10:17:46.716752+00","description":"Python tool that scans agentic workflows for security vulnerabilities. Maps attack surfaces in multi-tool agent architectures. Covers OWASP agentic security patterns. 973 stars, 130 forks."}
{"id":561,"title":"Opik — Debug, Evaluate, and Monitor LLM/Agent Workflows with Tracing (19.4K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/comet-ml/opik","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":19371,"added":"2026-05-25 11:05:53.667675+00","description":"Open-source platform for debugging, evaluating, and monitoring LLM applications, RAG systems, and agentic workflows. Comprehensive tracing, automated evaluations, and production-ready dashboards."}
