{"id":564,"title":"System Prompts & Models of AI Tools — Every AI Coding Agent's Internal Instructions Leaked (138K Stars)","url":"","category":"agent_security","stars":138217,"added":"2026-05-25 11:37:41.865438+00","description":"Full system prompts extracted from Claude Code, Cursor, Devin AI, Windsurf, Replit, Lovable, Bolt, v0, Perplexity, Trae, Warp.dev, Augment Code, and more. 138K stars, 34K forks, 146 open issues. GPL-3.0. Continuously updated with new tool prompts as they change."}
