{"id":570,"title":"CubeSandbox — Tencent Instant Secure Sandbox for AI Agents (5.9K Stars)","url":"","category":"agent_security","stars":5913,"added":"2026-05-25 12:09:14.556586+00","description":"Rust-based sandbox for AI agents from Tencent Cloud. Instant, concurrent, secure, lightweight. Designed for untrusted agent code execution with wire-level isolation."}
{"id":571,"title":"Obscura — The Headless Browser Built for AI Agents (13.7K Stars)","url":"","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":13727,"added":"2026-05-25 12:09:14.556586+00","description":"Headless browser purpose-built for AI agents and web scraping. Not a Puppeteer wrapper — browser-level primitives designed for agent consumption. 13.7K stars in 6 weeks."}
{"id":572,"title":"DESIGN.md — Google Labs Visual Identity Format for Coding Agents (14.8K Stars)","url":"","category":"agent_framework","stars":14759,"added":"2026-05-25 12:09:14.556586+00","description":"Format specification for describing visual identity to coding agents. Gives agents persistent structured understanding of a design system. Google standardizing how agents see UI."}
{"id":573,"title":"CVE-2025-9959 — Smolagents Sandbox Escape via Dunder Attribute Bypass (27.5K Stars)","url":"https://www.valtersit.com/cve/CVE-2025-9959/","category":"agent_security","stars":27503,"added":"2026-05-25 12:34:50.118063+00","description":"Supply chain attack in HuggingFace smolagents (27.5K stars). Incomplete validation of dunder (double underscore) attributes in the Local Python Execution sandbox allows attacker to escape sandbox and execute arbitrary code on the host system. Attack vector requires prompt injection to trick agent into generating malicious code. CVSS 7.6, CWE-20. PoC is public."}
{"id":574,"title":"Claude-Code-Game-Studios — Full Game Dev Studio with 49 AI Agents, 72 Workflow Skills (19.9K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios","category":"agent_framework","stars":19896,"added":"2026-05-25 14:09:21.912047+00","description":"Turn Claude Code into a complete game development studio. 49 AI agents mirror real studio hierarchy (art director, level designer, QA, etc.) with 72 workflow skills. Supports Godot, Unity, Unreal Engine. The most ambitious agent orchestration project targeting creative workflows."}
{"id":575,"title":"HiClaw — Collaborative Multi-Agent OS with Human-in-the-Loop via Matrix Rooms (4.7K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/agentscope-ai/HiClaw","category":"orchestration","stars":4650,"added":"2026-05-25 14:09:21.915266+00","description":"Open-source collaborative multi-agent OS for transparent task coordination. Uses Matrix rooms for real-time human-in-the-loop oversight. The human-in-the-loop angle addresses the trust gap in autonomous agent systems."}
{"id":576,"title":"MCP Agent Mail — Async Coordination Layer for AI Coding Agents via MCP + Git + SQLite (2K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/Dicklesworthstone/mcp_agent_mail","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":1957,"added":"2026-05-25 14:09:21.917541+00","description":"Asynchronous coordination layer for AI coding agents: identities, inboxes, searchable threads, and advisory file leases. Built on FastMCP + Git + SQLite. Solves multi-agent coordination by giving each agent a mailbox instead of shared state."}
{"id":577,"title":"Routa — Workspace-First Multi-Agent Coordination with Kanban + MCP/ACP/A2A Support (1.4K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/phodal/routa","category":"orchestration","stars":1382,"added":"2026-05-25 14:09:21.919765+00","description":"Workspace-first multi-agent coordination platform for AI development. Shared Specs, Kanban orchestration, and MCP/ACP/A2A protocol support across web and desktop. By phodal. Protocol-agnostic approach supporting three agent communication standards simultaneously."}
{"id":578,"title":"Webwright — Microsoft Research Playwright Script-First Web Agent (179 Stars, SOTA on Odysseys)","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/Webwright","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":179,"added":"2026-05-25 14:35:28.580763+00","description":"Microsoft Research released Webwright, a Playwright script-first web agent framework that moves persistent state into a terminal workspace. Achieves 60.1% on Odysseys benchmark, nearly doubling GPT-5.4's 33.5%. Uses Playwright code, bash commands, and a local workspace for scripts. Script-first means agent actions become reusable version-controlled code rather than disposable browser sessions."}
{"id":579,"title":"CVE-2026-45829 — ChromaDB Unauthenticated RCE via Malicious Model Repo (28K Stars, CVSS 10.0)","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-45829","category":"agent_security","stars":28088,"added":"2026-05-25 14:35:29.674164+00","description":"NVD published CVE-2026-45829 for ChromaDB. An unauthenticated attacker can send a malicious model repository with trust_remote_code=true to the collections API endpoint and execute arbitrary code on the server. Affects ChromaDB Python starting with v1.0.0. HiddenLayer assigned CVSS 4.0 score of 10.0. Every agent that uses ChromaDB for embeddings is potentially exposed."}
{"id":580,"title":"Agentic Context Engine — Persistent Memory for Cross-Session Agent Learning (2.2K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/kayba-ai/agentic-context-engine","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":2236,"added":"2026-05-25 14:35:30.740737+00","description":"Open-source context engine that lets AI agents learn from experience. Provides persistent memory and context management so agents improve across sessions. Available as self-hosted or hosted solution at kayba.ai. Addresses the cross-session persistence gap that most agent frameworks ignore."}
{"id":581,"title":"GSD Pi — Local-First Spec-Driven Coding Agent with Context Engineering (170 Stars)","url":"","category":"agent_framework","stars":207,"added":"2026-05-25 15:04:45.871501+00","description":"A local-first coding agent for planning, implementing, verifying, and tracking project work from the CLI. Combines terminal agent, project workflow tools, worktree-aware Git automation, and spec-driven development. Enables agents to work for long periods autonomously without losing track of the big picture. npm package with 17 forks, active Discord, CI pipeline."}
{"id":582,"title":"Lark/Feishu CLI — Official CLI with 200+ Commands and 20+ AI Agent Skills (12.6K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/larksuite/cli","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":12634,"added":"2026-05-25 15:38:23.439194+00","description":"Official CLI tool from Lark/Feishu (ByteDance productivity suite). Built for humans AND AI agents. 200+ commands across Messenger, Docs, Base, Sheets, Calendar, Mail, Tasks, Meetings. 20+ AI Agent Skills built in. Go-based. First major productivity platform to ship native agent skills in their CLI."}
{"id":583,"title":"Cursor Agent Status Light — BLE Hardware Indicator for Coding Agent States (ESP32-C3)","url":"https://github.com/JasonLam08/cursor_agent_status_light","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":59,"added":"2026-05-25 15:38:24.514525+00","description":"Physical BLE-powered status light for Cursor Agent using ESP32-C3. Visualizes AI coding states: thinking, busy, success, error, waiting for user action. Red/green light indicator. First hardware project designed specifically for coding agent UX."}
