{"id":587,"title":"Auto Deep Researcher 24x7 — Autonomous Agent for ML Experiments While You Sleep (952 Stars)","url":"","category":"agent_framework","stars":952,"added":"2026-05-25 16:05:02.905184+00","description":"An autonomous AI agent that runs your deep learning experiments 24/7. Zero-cost monitoring, Leader-Worker architecture, constant-size memory."}
