{"id":589,"title":"FastMCP — Pythonic Way to Build MCP Servers and Clients (25K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":25312,"added":"2026-05-25 16:37:13.811114+00","description":"From PrefectHQ. Build MCP servers and clients in pure Python with decorators and type hints. 25K stars, Apache 2.0. The fastest-growing MCP framework. Makes server construction 3 lines of code vs manual JSON schema wiring. Supports tools, resources, prompts, and composability."}
{"id":590,"title":"Token Savior — MCP Server Cuts Claude Tokens 77%, 0 Losses on 96-Task Benchmark (905 Stars)","url":"https://github.com/Mibayy/token-savior","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":905,"added":"2026-05-25 17:07:12.425351+00","description":"Structural code navigation + persistent memory MCP server. Benchmarked: -77% active tokens, -76% wall time, 0 losses across 96 tasks on Opus 4.7. Works with every MCP client."}
{"id":591,"title":"ViMax — Agentic Video Generation: 4 Agents (Director, Writer, Producer, Generator) in One (7.5K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/HKUDS/ViMax","category":"agent_framework","stars":7497,"added":"2026-05-25 17:07:13.532162+00","description":"Four specialized agents collaborate to produce videos end-to-end. Each agent has distinct role: Director orchestrates, Screenwriter writes, Producer manages resources, Video Generator renders. By HKUDS."}
{"id":592,"title":"Supertonic — On-Device Multilingual TTS via ONNX, Zero Cloud Dependency (10.4K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/supertone-inc/supertonic","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":10407,"added":"2026-05-25 17:07:14.630842+00","description":"Text-to-speech running natively via ONNX. 20+ languages. iOS, Android, Web, Python, Rust, Go, Java, C#, Node.js, Flutter. No cloud API needed."}
{"id":593,"title":"AlphaProof Nexus — DeepMind Agent Solves 9 Erdős Problems Including Two Open 56 Years","url":"https://twitter.com/pushmeet/status/2058936037754224998","category":"agent_framework","stars":52,"added":"2026-05-25 17:07:15.738326+00","description":"Google DeepMind agentic framework for formal proof search powered by Gemini. Solved 9 open Erdős problems, 44 OEIS conjectures, a 15-year algebraic geometry problem, a 7-year min-max optimization question. LLM proposes proof, Lean compiler verifies every step. Cost: few hundred dollars per problem. The \"build a tighter verification loop\" paradigm."}
{"id":594,"title":"LongCat-Video — Open-Source SOTA Talking Avatar Model by Meituan (2.9K Stars)","url":"https://x.com/victormustar/status/2058492201261244458","category":"agent_framework","stars":2854,"added":"2026-05-25 17:35:18.902488+00","description":"MIT-licensed talking-head video generation model from Meituan. Feed portrait + audio, get realistic talking avatar. SOTA quality. Runs local. Use cases: AI tutors with faces, dubbing, talking coding agents, NPC dialogue. HuggingFace demo available. Went viral on Twitter (168K views, 1646 likes)."}
{"id":595,"title":"Microsoft AI-Engineering-Coach — VS Code Extension That Analyzes Your Agent Sessions (1.2K Stars)","url":"https://x.com/filicroval/status/2058555935027499407","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":1200,"added":"2026-05-25 17:35:18.90614+00","description":"Open-source VS Code extension from Microsoft that reads local AI session logs (Copilot, Claude, Cursor, Windsurf — any harness) and turns them into analytics dashboard. 45+ anti-pattern rules covering prompt quality, context health, session hygiene. Gamified with XP, achievements, skill tracking. All data stays local."}
{"id":596,"title":"OpenSwarm — Claude Code for Everything Except Coding (2.5K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/VRSEN/OpenSwarm","category":"agent_framework","stars":2536,"added":"2026-05-25 17:35:18.9089+00","description":"MIT-licensed framework extending Claude Code beyond code. Agent orchestration for non-coding: research, planning, data analysis, automation. Same harness, different domain. 2.5K stars with active development. Part of the trend repurposing coding agent architectures for general agent work."}
{"id":597,"title":"Claude Memory Compiler — Codebase Memory That Evolves via Session Hooks (1.1K Stars)","url":"https://github.com/coleam00/claude-memory-compiler","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":1093,"added":"2026-05-25 17:35:18.912513+00","description":"Hooks automatically capture Claude Code sessions, Agent SDK extracts key decisions and lessons, LLM compiler organizes into structured cross-referenced knowledge articles. Inspired by Karpathy LLM Knowledge Base architecture. Solves cross-session persistence gap for coding agents."}
