{"id":604,"title":"auth.md — Open Protocol for Agent Authentication via Domain Markdown by WorkOS (118 Stars)","url":"https://github.com/workos/auth.md","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":128,"added":"2026-05-25 19:35:13.033372+00","description":"Open protocol by WorkOS. Agents register for services on behalf of users through a Markdown file at the domain. Discoverable, machine-readable auth delegation. Solves the agent authentication problem without sharing credentials."}
{"id":605,"title":"Engram — Hybrid Long-Term Memory for OpenClaw Agents: SQLite+FTS5 + LanceDB Semantic Recall (119 Stars)","url":"https://github.com/NanoFlow-io/engram","category":"agent_infrastructure","stars":119,"added":"2026-05-25 19:35:13.036172+00","description":"Hybrid memory plugin for OpenClaw agents. SQLite+FTS5 for structured facts, LanceDB for semantic recall. TypeScript. Dual retrieval: keyword-exact and semantic similarity in one plugin."}
