{"id":691,"title":"GSD (Get Shit Done) AI Coding Tool — Rug Pull Evolves Into Supply Chain Backdoor","url":"https://x.com/Shieldguardio/status/2059174419348721827","category":"agent_security","stars":0,"added":"2026-05-26 08:09:08.264748+00","description":"Anonymous GSD founder launched $GSD token, drained liquidity, deleted socials. Still controls NPM registry keys for get-shit-done-cc and @gsd-build/sdk packages. Tool runs with deep local shell/bash permissions for autonomous code execution — rogue dev can push malicious payload update anytime. Every GSD user is a target."}
